Dear Mayor Kaysen&Council:
Please accept the accompanying liquor license applications on behalf of wR cH Accomplice, LLC
the entity formed to operatea micro brewery and limited service restaurant(aka“fastcasual",)
at the Historic Union Pacific Depot, at115W.15th Street in downtown Cheyenne.
Chop House location, we could not be happier by the reception granted us by the citizens of
menu of pork ribs, chicken wings andsalads along with a variety of regional craft beers in a
friendly setting that will have limited table service, but interesting technology that will combine
for what we expect willbe a new, engaging and enjoyable customer experience.Laterthis
summer once equipment as been obtained & installed wewill add a brewery operation to begin
brewingand serving our own Accomplice-branded craft beers.
As you are well aware, there are some specific considerations and circumstances extant atthe
Depot location.We look forward to working closely with the City to resolve these issues and to
launch our enterprise, as both a member of your business community and atenantof the City-
owned property.
