employees, contractors, guests, visitors and invitees. The term“Common Areas”
as used herein shall mean all areas of the Building devoted to open corridors,
lobbies, elevator foyers, restrooms, vending areas, driveways, streets, sidewalks,
elevated walkways and other similar facilities which Lessor makes available for
the common use orbenefit of tenants generally and/or the public, but in any event
